config FS_SFS
	bool "Amiga SmartFileSystem (SFS) filesystem support"
	help
	  This provides a read-only driver for the Amiga SmartFileSystem
	  (SFS), as used on AmigaOS / AmigaOne RDB (Rigid Disk Block)
	  partitions.  It plugs into U-Boot's generic filesystem framework,
	  so the fstype, ls, load and size commands work on SFS partitions.
